From 7bb40b5857739c47688cde5e1dc944e38e0356d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philippe Gerum <rpm@xenomai.org>
Date: Wed, 24 Apr 2019 16:40:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 077/217] x86: irq_pipeline: add IRQ pipeline core

Signed-off-by: Philippe Gerum <rpm@xenomai.org>
Signed-off-by: Jan Kiszka <jan.kiszka@siemens.com>

x86: dovetail: Fix Intel shadow stack support

Let fpregs_lock_and_load return the saved flags of fpregs_lock and make
sure that the shadow stack callers use that properly.

Signed-off-by: Jan Kiszka <jan.kiszka@siemens.com>
